## Dev notes (devnote)
- During brainstorming and implementation, when a sub-problem appears or is resolved, a decision is made, a pitfall is solved, or we wrap up, use the devnote skill to update docs/superpowers/handoff/<topic>.md
- At the start of any session, check docs/superpowers/handoff/ for unfinished files; if any, restate the status line before continuing
- When the design doc is written, paste the tree and the key decisions at its top and keep using the handoff file; move it to handoff/done/ only when the topic is closed

## 開發筆記（devnote）
- brainstorming 與實作中，子問題出現、有結論、做出決策、踩坑解掉或收工時，用 devnote skill 更新 docs/superpowers/handoff/<topic>.md
- 任何 session 開始前，先檢查 docs/superpowers/handoff/ 有沒有未完成的檔；有就先複述狀態列再繼續
- 設計文件寫出時，把樹和關鍵決策貼進設計文件開頭，handoff 檔繼續用；結案才移到 handoff/done/
